Table full name: NEW_YORK_PLUS.NEW_YORK_SUBWAY.STOP_TIMES
Column name: stop_sequence Type: TEXT Description: Identifies the order of the stops for a particular trip. The values for stop_sequence must increase throughout the trip but do not need to be consecutive.
Column name: trip_id Type: TEXT Description: Identifies a trip. Multiple trips can have the same stop
Column name: arrival_time Type: TEXT Description: Specifies the scheduled arrival time at a specific stop for a specific trip on a route.
Column name: departure_time Type: TEXT Description: Specifies the scheduled departure time at a specific stop for a specific trip on a route.
Column name: stop_id Type: TEXT Description: Identifies the serviced stop. Multiple routes can use the same stop.
Column name: pickup_type Type: TEXT
Column name: shape_dist_traveled Type: TEXT
Column name: stop_headsign Type: TEXT
Column name: dropoff_type Type: TEXT Description: "Indicates whether riders are dropped off at a stop as part of the normal schedule or whether a drop off at the stop isn't available. Available options:  -  regular -  none -  phone (indicates must phone agency to arrange drop off) -  driver (indicates must coordinate with driver to arrange drop off)"
