Column name: data_file_month Type: NUMBER Description: Datafile timestamp month value
Column name: store_and_fwd_flag Type: TEXT Description: This flag indicates whether the trip record was held in vehicle memory before sending to the vendor, aka 'store and forward,' because the vehicle did not have a connection to the server. Y= store and forward trip N= not a store and forward trip
