Table full name: NEW_YORK_PLUS.NEW_YORK_TREES.TREE_CENSUS_1995
Column name: species Type: TEXT Description: Species of the tree using a four-letter code, comprised of the first two letters of the genus followed by the first two letters of the species.
Column name: sidewalk_condition Type: TEXT Description: Whether the tree roots have lifted the adjacent sidewalk.
Column name: segmentid Type: NUMBER Description: LION SegmentID geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: censustract_2010 Type: TEXT Description: 2010 Census Tract geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: zip_original Type: NUMBER Description: The zip code originally geocoded to the address using LION 02A
Column name: nta_2010 Type: TEXT Description: Neighborhood Tabulation Area geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: site Type: TEXT Description: This field clarifies the position relative to the address for trees not located in the front of buildings.
Column name: house_number Type: TEXT Description: Numerical portion of the address.
Column name: spc_latin Type: TEXT Description: This is the latin/scientific name for the species of this tree.
Column name: address Type: TEXT Description: Address of the tree.
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT Description: Longitude of point in decimal degrees as geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: spc_common Type: TEXT Description: This is the common name for the species of this tree.
Column name: wires Type: TEXT Description: Whether the tree is located under utility wires
Column name: location Type: TEXT
Column name: censusblock_2010 Type: TEXT Description: 2010 Census Block geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: borough Type: TEXT Description: Borough where tree was recorded.
Column name: zip_new Type: NUMBER Description: Zip Code geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: recordid Type: NUMBER Description: A unique identifier for each record in the table. Does not correspond to other datasets or identify the tree itself.
Column name: status Type: TEXT Description: Overall tree condition.
Column name: cb_new Type: NUMBER Description: Community Board geocoded to the address using Geosupport 11.4
Column name: support_structure Type: TEXT Description: Whether the tree has support structures installed.
Column name: y Type: FLOAT Description: Y coordinate of point in the NAD_1983_StatePlane_New_York_Long_Island_FIPS_3104_Feet coordinate system, geocoded using LION 02A
Column name: diameter Type: NUMBER Description: Diameter of the tree as measured at approximately 4.5 feet from the ground.
Column name: street Type: TEXT Description: Street where address for tree is located.
Column name: cb_original Type: NUMBER Description: The community board originally geocoded to the address using LION 02A
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT Description: Latitude of point in decimal degrees as geocoded using LION 02A
